WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
The grid fails at midnight.
Mika holds the medical case and looks up at the dark towers.

00:03.000 --> 00:05.300
Mika runs up the dark stairwell with her flashlight.

00:05.300 --> 00:07.500
Neighbors pass the case hand to hand up the stairs.

00:07.500 --> 00:12.000
At sunrise the case reaches Mrs. Ito.
A small bird of light fades on the windowsill.
